{"id":"a7c552d86adb7559","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-topo8-hyperspace.md","title":"ZFC Topo8 Hyperspace","display":"df-zfc-topo8-hyperspace — ZFC Topo8 Hyperspace","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo8-hyperspace","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo8-hyperspace"],"display":"df-zfc-topo8-hyperspace — ZFC Topo8 Hyperspace","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo8-hyperspace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo8-hyperspace</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo8-hyperspace — ZFC Topo8 Hyperspace"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal F,X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8Hyperspace}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8Hyperspace}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}hyperspace} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8Hyperspace}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal F=\\{F\\in\\mathcal P(X):F\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,F)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}hyperspace} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8Hyperspace}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal F=\\{F\\in\\mathcal P(X):F\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,F)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 是所有非空闭子集组成的 hyperspace 载体；闭集谓词同时保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> 为拓扑空间。</li>\n<li>本原子只定义载体，未声称已赋予 Vietoris、Fell 或 Hausdorff-metric 拓扑。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"4dc8b2d2e69010a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"4dc8b2d2e69010a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^3$（见 [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F,X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8Hyperspace}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}hyperspace} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo8Hyperspace}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal F=\\{F\\in\\mathcal P(X):F\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,F)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false}],"bytes":989,"backlinks":[{"id":"0a4b70b97b1e6df5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3702","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-topo8-hyperspace.md|58-df-zfc-topo8-hyperspace]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","4dc8b2d2e69010a2"]}